mapping "V2330.1" source="V2330" target="10298002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V2330 = Swedish 6-digit extension of ICD-10 V23.3 (person boarding/alighting a
        motorcycle, injured in collision with car/pick-up/van) + activity suffix SNOMED CT 10298002
        242107006 57701003 (sport/exercise). Parent V23.3 has Athena edges to SNOMED CT 438310 (Victim,
        motorcycle rider in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, code 10298002) and 4053428 (Accident
        while boarding or alighting from motor vehicle on road, code 242107006); both fully subsume the
        injury event of the source (broader, one level less specific, verified crosswalk). Activity
        aspect maps to SNOMED CT 440288 (Accident while engaged in sports activity, code 57701003); partial
        because the source bundles injury+activity and this target covers only the activity component.
        No single SNOMED CT concept expresses the full Swedish combination.
        """
}
